    correction: [{"quoi":"نتعرّف على العامل المشترك","math":"الحدّان يحتويان على الجذر <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نبسّط الجذر","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">112</span></span> = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">16 × 7</span></span> = 4<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span></span>"},{"quoi":"نضع <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span></span> عاملا مشتركا","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">4x<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span> - 4<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span> = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span>(4x - 4)</span>"},{"quoi":"النتيجة","math":"<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">7</span></span>(4x - 4)</span>"}],
